WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.555 line:83%
You've opened HUWiki, and Google is asking for
access.

00:00:03.555 --> 00:00:07.900 line:83%
Before you decide, here's what each permission
does in the app.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.288 line:83%
Let's start with Drive.

00:00:09.288 --> 00:00:13.797 line:83%
HUWiki stores a wiki as a folder of pages,
images and other files.

00:00:13.797 --> 00:00:16.919 line:83%
When a collaborator adds a page or an image,

00:00:16.919 --> 00:00:20.388 line:83%
the other members need to be able to open it.

00:00:20.388 --> 00:00:23.856 line:83%
File-by-file access can miss new files created
by someone else.

00:00:23.856 --> 00:00:26.978 line:83%
The full Drive version asks for broader access
so

00:00:26.978 --> 00:00:30.100 line:83%
it can find those files inside a shared wiki.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.860 line:83%
Full Drive access is a broad permission.

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:36.408 line:83%
It lets HUWiki read, create, change and delete
files

00:00:36.408 --> 00:00:40.350 line:83%
across your Drive, within the rights your
account already has.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:43.110 line:83%
It covers more than the wiki folder.

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:46.658 line:83%
The limited-access version asks for access to
specific files.

00:00:46.658 --> 00:00:50.600 line:83%
Check which version of the permission Google is
showing you.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:53.800 line:83%
Email access lets HUWiki send an invitation
when

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:57.000 line:83%
you choose to invite someone to a wiki.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.600 line:83%
This permission does not let HUWiki read your
inbox.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:04.600 line:83%
Drive permissions still control who can open
the shared files.

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:06.103 line:83%
Calendar access is read-only.

00:01:06.103 --> 00:01:11.366 line:83%
You can bring your events into a wiki and see
them alongside your notes.

00:01:11.366 --> 00:01:15.500 line:83%
This permission does not let HUWiki change
events in Google Calendar.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:18.527 line:83%
The internet connection lets HUWiki talk to
Google

00:01:18.527 --> 00:01:21.554 line:83%
services and load the files a wiki needs.

00:01:21.554 --> 00:01:25.338 line:83%
If you choose a cloud AI feature, HUWiki also
uses

00:01:25.338 --> 00:01:29.500 line:83%
that connection to send your request to the
provider you select.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:34.300 line:83%
Forms access lets Shop Edition create and edit
a Google order form.

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:37.500 line:83%
A customer fills it in, and HUWiki brings

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:40.700 line:83%
the response into the shop's private order
book.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:43.701 line:83%
You can review these permissions before you
continue,

00:01:43.701 --> 00:01:46.703 line:83%
and remove access later in your Google Account.

00:01:46.703 --> 00:01:50.830 line:83%
For more about how HUWiki handles data, see our
privacy page.

